msgstr ""
"Elŝutu [la eldonon 64-bita AppImage por Kate](https://binary-factory.kde.org/"
"job/Kate_Release_appimage-centos7/). *"

#: content/get-it.md:26
msgid ""
"Download [the nightly 64-bit AppImage for Kate](https://binary-factory.kde."
