msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Vindozo"

#: content/get-it.md:34
msgid ""
"Install [Kate from the Microsoft Store](https://www.microsoft.com/store/"
"apps/9NWMW7BB59HW)."
msgstr ""
"Instalu [Kate el la Microsoft Store](https://www.microsoft.com/store/"
"apps/9NWMW7BB59HW)."

#: content/get-it.md:39
msgid ""
"Download [the nightly Kate 64-bit installer](https://binary-factory.kde.org/"
"view/Windows%2064-bit/job/Kate_Nightly_win64/). **"
msgstr ""
"Elŝutu [la noktan Kate 64-bitan instalilon](https://binary-factory.kde.org/"
