#: content/get-it.md:40
msgid ""
"Install [Kate via Chocolatey](https://chocolatey.org/packages/kate). \\*\\*"
"\\*"
msgstr ""
"Instalu [Kate per Chocolatey](https://chocolatey.org/packages/kate). \\*\\*"
"\\*"

#: content/get-it.md:46
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: content/get-it.md:48
msgid ""
"Download the [Kate release installer](https://binary-factory.kde.org/view/"
"MacOS/job/Kate_Release_macos/). *"
msgstr ""
"Elŝutu la [Kate-eldoninstalilon](https://binary-factory.kde.org/view/MacOS/"
"job/Kate_Release_macos/). *"

#: content/get-it.md:49
