"buglist.cgi?product=frameworks-syntax-highlighting&bug_status=UNCONFIRMED"
"&bug_status=CONFIRMED&bug_status=ASSIGNED&bug_status=REOPENED&bug_severity="
"critical&bug_severity=grave&bug_severity=major&bug_severity=crash&bug_severity"
"=normal&bug_severity=minor\">Cimspurilo por KSyntaxHighlighting</a>"

#: content/join-us.md:65
msgid ""
