#: content/mascot.md:12
msgid ""
"Kate's mascot, Kate the Cyber Woodpecker, was designed by [Tyson Tan]"
"(https://www.tysontan.com/)."
msgstr ""
"La maskoto de Kate, Kejt la Kiber-Pego, estis dizajnita fare de [Tyson Tan]"
"(https://www.tysontan.com/)."

#: content/mascot.md:14
msgid ""
"The current evolution of our mascot was first unveiled [in April 2021](/"
"post/2021/2021-04-28-lets-welcome-kate-the-cyber-woodpecker/)."
msgstr ""
"La nuna evoluo de nia maskoto estis unue malkaŝita [en aprilo 2021](/"
"post/2021/2021-04-28-lets-welcome-kate-the-cyber-woodpecker/)."

#: content/mascot.md:16
msgid "Kate the Cyber Woodpecker"
msgstr "Kejt la Kiberpego"

#: content/mascot.md:18
msgid ""
